flowchart LR
  A[Sources<br/>DBs • APIs • Files • Events] --> B[Ingestion<br/>Batch • CDC • Streaming]
  B --> C[Raw Landing Zone<br/>Object Storage or Raw Topics<br/>Immutable]
  C --> D[Validation & Quality Gates<br/>Schema • DQ checks]
  D -->|Pass| E[Transform<br/>ETL or ELT]
  D -->|Fail| X[Quarantine / DLQ<br/>Error bucket • DLQ topic]

  E --> F[Curated Layers<br/>Bronze → Silver → Gold]
  F --> G[Serving / Targets<br/>Warehouse • Marts • Read Models • Feature Store]
  G --> H[Consumers<br/>BI • Apps • ML • APIs]

  O[Orchestration<br/>Schedules • Retries • Backfills] -.-> B
  O -.-> E
  M[Observability<br/>Freshness • Lag • Errors • Lineage] -.-> B
  M -.-> E
  M -.-> G
  S[Governance & Security<br/>PII • ACLs • Retention] -.-> C
  S -.-> F
  S -.-> G